  Normal  ScalingReplicaSet  91s                deployment-controller  Scaled down replica set api-6859cf8794 from 1 to 0
  Normal  ScalingReplicaSet  45s (x2 over 51s)  deployment-controller  Scaled up replica set api-685ff46f8f from 1 to 4
  Normal  ScalingReplicaSet  12s                deployment-controller  Scaled down replica set api-685ff46f8f from 4 to 2
